<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Airlock jammed shut. Must be forced open.-->
  <VQE_AirlockJammed>气闸卡住了。必须强制打开。</VQE_AirlockJammed>
  <!--EN: Cryptogenerator running low-->
  <VQE_Alert_CriticalCryptoGenerators>密码生成器运行缓慢</VQE_Alert_CriticalCryptoGenerators>
  <!--EN: A cryptogenerator only has enough fuel left for less than a day. When fuel runs out, it will meltdown, destroying everything in radius.-->
  <VQE_Alert_CriticalCryptoGenerators_Desc>加密发电机的燃料仅够使用不到一天。当燃料耗尽时，它会熔化，摧毁半径内的一切。</VQE_Alert_CriticalCryptoGenerators_Desc>
  <!--EN: Cancel-->
  <VQE_CancelScavenge>取消</VQE_CancelScavenge>
  <!--EN: Cancel scavenging this object.-->
  <VQE_CancelScavengeDesc>取消清理该对象。</VQE_CancelScavengeDesc>
  <!--EN: {PAWN_nameDef} joins-->
  <VQE_HeroJoins>{PAWN_nameDef} 加入</VQE_HeroJoins>
  <!--EN: The {PAWN_title} known as {PAWN_nameDef} has emerged from a cryptosleep casket in a daze. Once they regain their bearings, they will join your colony.\n\n{PAWN_nameFull} is the legendary blacksmith of a renowned spacefaring civilization, famed for their mastery of cryptoparticle technology. A gifted crafter and battle-hardened warrior, {PAWN_labelShort} wears a set of cryptotech armor from their lost people. But beneath their skill and strength lies a heavy burden of guilt, a unique psychological condition born from the crushing sorrow of being the last living member of their civilization. This grief gnaws at {PAWN_possessive} mind over time, slowly deepening into despair. However, engaging in work that aligns with their passions: especially crafting, can slow the progression. If managed carefully, the guilt will eventually transform into acceptance, and with time, begin to fade.-->
  <VQE_HeroJoinsDesc>被称为{PAWN_nameDef}的{PAWN_title}在茫然中从加密睡眠棺材中出现。一旦他们重新定位，他们就会加入您的殖民地。

{PAWN_nameFull} 是著名航天文明的传奇铁匠，以掌握密码粒子技术而闻名。一位才华横溢的工匠和久经沙场的战士，{PAWN_labelShort} 穿着一套来自失落之人的加密科技盔甲。但在他们的技能和力量之下隐藏着沉重的负罪感，这是一种独特的心理状况，源于作为他们文明中最后一个活着的成员的极度悲伤。随着时间的推移，这种悲伤侵蚀着 {PAWN_possessive} 的心灵，慢慢加深为绝望。然而，从事与他们的热情相符的工作：尤其是手工制作，可能会减缓进展。如果小心处理，内疚最终会转变为接受，并且随着时间的推移，开始消失。</VQE_HeroJoinsDesc>
  <!--EN: Initiate scan-->
  <VQE_InitiateScan>启动扫描</VQE_InitiateScan>
  <!--EN: Initiate the proximity scan to find large signatures in the area. The scan is bound to generate enough of an energy signature to attract a mechanoid hive.-->
  <VQE_InitiateScanDesc>启动近距离扫描以查找该区域中的大签名。扫描是绑定以产生足够的能量信号来吸引机械蜂巢。</VQE_InitiateScanDesc>
  <!--EN: Scavenge-->
  <VQE_LootChunk>拾荒</VQE_LootChunk>
  <!--EN: This is the only opportunity to craft more legendary crypto gear, provided you have the resources to do so. You can secure the site and send more resources in, but once you leave it, you will never be able to find it again.-->
  <VQE_QuestCompletedMessage>如果您有足够的资源，这是制作更多传奇加密装备的唯一机会。您可以保护该站点并发送更多资源，但一旦离开它，您将永远无法再找到它。</VQE_QuestCompletedMessage>
  <!--EN: Restart generator-->
  <VQE_RestartGenerator>重启发电机</VQE_RestartGenerator>
  <!--EN: Restart the cryptogenerator. It has enough fuel to run continuously for three days, after which it will critically meltdown. The strong energy signature is bound to attract the mechanoid hive.-->
  <VQE_RestartGeneratorDesc>重新启动密码生成器。它有足够的燃料连续运行三天，之后它将严重熔化。强烈的能量信号是束缚来吸引机械体蜂巢。</VQE_RestartGeneratorDesc>
  <!--EN: Restarting the cryptogenerator will cause continuous mechanoid attacks.-->
  <VQE_RestartWarning>重新启动密码生成器将导致连续的机械攻击。</VQE_RestartWarning>
  <!--EN: The scan has completed.-->
  <VQE_ScanComplete>扫描已完成。</VQE_ScanComplete>
  <!--EN: The scan will take some time to complete. Leaving the site will cancel the scan.-->
  <VQE_ScanStarted>扫描需要一些时间才能完成。离开站点将取消扫描。</VQE_ScanStarted>
  <!--EN: Scavenge {0}-->
  <VQE_Scavenge>清理 {0}</VQE_Scavenge>
  <!--EN: Clean up the {0} while searching for valuable materials.-->
  <VQE_ScavengeDesc>清理{0}，同时寻找有价值的材料。</VQE_ScavengeDesc>
  <!--EN: Study ancient black box-->
  <VQE_StudyBlackBox>研究古代黑匣子</VQE_StudyBlackBox>
  <!--EN: Access the data on the black box to find out what transpired.-->
  <VQE_StudyBlackBoxDesc>访问黑匣子上的数据以查明发生了什么。</VQE_StudyBlackBoxDesc>
  <!--EN: Study ancient blueprints-->
  <VQE_StudyBlueprints>研究古代蓝图</VQE_StudyBlueprints>
  <!--EN: Study the ancient blueprints and diagrams to gain inspiration for the next crafting project.-->
  <VQE_StudyBlueprintsDesc>研究古代蓝图和图表，以获得下一个手工项目的灵感。</VQE_StudyBlueprintsDesc>
</LanguageData>
